cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If this dataset or toolchain supports your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Philippine Barangay Boundaries GeoJSON with PSGC Codes and RDF Change History"
abstract: >-
  Curated hierarchical Philippine administrative boundaries as per-class GeoJSON (barangay,
  municipality, cities split by legal class, province, region), with each polygon annotated with its
  canonical Philippine Standard Geographic Code (PSGC). The full ADM0–ADM4 enriched files and the
  pre-enrichment raw NAMRIA conversion are preserved as intermediate pipeline stages. Derived from
  PSA PSGC snapshots and NAMRIA administrative-boundary shapefiles (v2023-11-06). Includes a
  quarterly PSGC change history published as W3C ORG RDF linked data across 17 snapshots
  (2021-08-19 to 2026-04-13).
